                  <p><span class="largetext">Yeah, zuney, I tend to stick up for the good folks in game. Hell, jaya may remember him if she thinks about it:). Carmon and I were a couple of crazy porting fools back in the day for KoT.  in fact, I think we were made officers because of our porting abilities and it was our job to herd all the forces and port them to the raids.... 90 minutes late everytime, but that wasn't our fault.  Everyone had to go to the bank or drop something off to a friend or do an item trans.  It was always something that caused our raids to start late, at least Carmon and I were always on time, that is, until we had to go pick up everyone and then walk them through the zones to the raid site.  
